{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A straightforward SRPG inspired by 16-bit classics and made with SRPG Studio. The storyline follows the armies of Prince Abel of Meyr as he battles the invading forces of Pherrelios. The third entry of Clarent Saga.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storyline follows the armies of Prince Abel of Meyr as he battles the invading forces of Pherrelios. At the same time, the cult of Brax threatens the peace by trying to summon and resurrect Baal, the fallen god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Adjustable difficulty (8 Difficulties) and a lot of options; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A very detailed tutorial; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 28 playable characters; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 35 Small Maps with 6 Extra Maps; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A 3 part story involving 2 generations; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast strategic battle. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/709670?t=1760549383","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/709670?t=1760549383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760549383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760549383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"- dark themes such as prostitution, incest, murder\r\nare implied or mentioned through dialogue or text only.\r\n\r\nThere is no visual or explicit representation of violence and sex. "},"detailed_description":